    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότῠπ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>original, primitive</i>,
			esp. in Gramm. sense, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).167
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				<u>Proll.Heph.</u>
				p.86
			</span></i> C.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀντωνυμίαι</span>, of
			personal pronouns, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτητικός</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				62.15
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράγωγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				166.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>archetypal</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				277.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				340
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότυπος, ὁ</span>, <i>principal party</i> to a contract, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				136.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότυπον, τό</span>, <i>archetype, original</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>”
				<i>originally, chiefly, in the first instance,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					POxy.
					902.13
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(v A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				48.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
